          "start": 1412,
          "text": "    with v1.selected([p for p in packets if route(p) is v1]), v2.selected([p for p in packets if route(p) is v2]), v3.selected([p for p in packets if route(p) is v3]), v4.selected([p for p in packets if route(p) is v4]):\n"
