          "text": "    return not (v1.IN_NATIVE.get() or v2.IN_NATIVE.get() or v3.IN_NATIVE.get() or v4.IN_NATIVE.get()) and bool(v1.SELECTED.get() or v2.SELECTED.get() or v3.SELECTED.get() or v4.SELECTED.get())\n"
        },
